/*
  ConditionBuilder.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0083 · ConditionBuilder (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  ConditionBuilder resolves (table "ConditionBuilder") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  Group 1 mirrors the exact key set extracted from the web source
  (features/automations/pages/ConditionBuilder.tsx) — the builder labels, the
  condition-type / operator / geofence-state / other-automation-state options, the
  signal-field labels (English in lib/signals.ts, routed through the facade here),
  the day short-names, and the timezone labels. Group 2 backs the native-only chrome
  (freshness / loading / empty / error / offline / retry) the Apple HIG states
  contract requires for the `useGeofences` source.
*/

